  "description": "The deterministic half of ai-sdlc, which holds an AI coding agent, and the people directing it, to what was written down. Every change is planned before any code exists, challenged by a reader that never saw it written, approved by a person against the exact text, and proved from recorded evidence, against rules and decisions that live in the repository and carry from one cycle to the next. This is the `sdlc` command every host hook and pipeline step calls: it decides everything a program can, including the pull-request check that refuses a change whose chain is incomplete, unapproved or hash-mismatched. The stages need language and ship separately as the plugin.",
